# Stitch MCP Integration

The UI design source of truth is Google Stitch. Always fetch the latest Stitch HTML before updating any page.

## MCP Config
```json
// ~/.cursor/mcp.json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "stitch": {
      "url": "https://stitch.googleapis.com/mcp",
      "headers": { "X-Goog-Api-Key": "<key>" }
    }
  }
}
```

